---
title: Maintenance Module - Class Diagram
---
classDiagram
    class MaintenanceModule {
        <<Module>>
        +MaintenanceController
        +MaintenanceService
        +StaffModule
    }

    class MaintenanceController {
        <<Controller>>
        -maintenanceService: MaintenanceService
        +POST issues ReportIssueDto IssueReport
        +GET issues IssueReport[]
        +GET my-issues IssueAssignment[]
        +POST issues/:id/prove ProveIssueDto MaintenanceProve
        +GET issues/:id/proves MaintenanceProve[]
        +POST assignments AssignIssueDto IssueAssignment
    }

    class MaintenanceService {
        <<Service>>
        -issueRepo: Repository~IssueReport~
        -proveRepo: Repository~MaintenanceProve~
        -assignmentRepo: Repository~IssueAssignment~
        -dataSource: DataSource
        -staffService: StaffService
        +reportIssue(reporterAccountId, dto) IssueReport
        +listIssues() IssueReport[]
        +listMyIssues(accountId) IssueAssignment[]
        +proveIssue(maintainerAccountId, issueId, dto) MaintenanceProve
        +listProves(issueId) MaintenanceProve[]
        +assignIssue(managerAccountId, issueId, maintainerStaffId) IssueAssignment
    }

    class IssueReport {
        <<Entity>>
        +issueId: uuid
        +roomId: uuid
        +reporterId: uuid
        +description: string
        +issueImage: string
        +status: string
        +createdAt: Date
    }

    class MaintenanceProve {
        <<Entity>>
        +proveId: uuid
        +issueId: uuid
        +maintainerId: uuid
        +finishImage: string
        +finishVideo: string
        +resolvedAt: Date
    }

    class IssueAssignment {
        <<Entity>>
        +assignmentId: uuid
        +issueId: uuid
        +maintainerId: uuid
        +assignedBy: uuid
        +assignedAt: Date
    }

    class Room {
        <<Entity>>
        +roomId: uuid
        +roomCode: string
        +status: string
    }

    class StaffInfo {
        <<Entity>>
        +staffId: uuid
        +accountId: uuid
        +fullName: string
    }

    class StaffService {
        <<Service>>
        +findByAccountId(accountId) StaffInfo
        +findOne(staffId) StaffInfo
    }

    class ReportIssueDto {
        <<DTO>>
        +roomId: uuid
        +description: string
        +issueImage: string
    }

    class ProveIssueDto {
        <<DTO>>
        +finishImage: string
        +finishVideo: string
    }

    class AssignIssueDto {
        <<DTO>>
        +issueId: uuid
        +maintainerStaffId: uuid
    }

    MaintenanceModule --> MaintenanceController
    MaintenanceModule --> MaintenanceService
    MaintenanceModule --> StaffModule
    MaintenanceController --> MaintenanceService
    MaintenanceService --> StaffService : resolves StaffId by accountId
    MaintenanceService --> IssueReport : persist + status update
    MaintenanceService --> MaintenanceProve : persist
    MaintenanceService --> IssueAssignment : persist + check

    IssueReport --> Room : RoomID
    IssueReport --> StaffInfo : ReporterId
    MaintenanceProve --> IssueReport : IssueId
    MaintenanceProve --> StaffInfo : MaintainerId
    IssueAssignment --> IssueReport : IssueId
    IssueAssignment --> StaffInfo : MaintainerId

    MaintenanceService ..> ReportIssueDto
    MaintenanceService ..> ProveIssueDto
    MaintenanceService ..> AssignIssueDto

    note for MaintenanceController "Roles: User|Receptionist|Cleaner|Maintainer|Manager report, Manager|Receptionist|Maintainer list, Maintainer|Manager my-issues+prove, Manager only assignments, Manager|Receptionist|Maintainer proves"
    note for MaintenanceService "proveIssue runs in dataSource.transaction: insert MaintenanceProve then update IssueReports.Status='Resolved'. No room status mutation."
    note for IssueAssignment "Manager assigns Maintainer to Issue. Maintainer must have assignment before prove (403 otherwise)."
    note for IssueReport "Status lifecycle: Pending -> Resolved (set by proveIssue). reportIssue always creates Pending."
